{% comment %}
  FUEL_01 variant announcement row. Rendered inside the offer-timebar link,
  between the top banner and the control offer row, and shipped hidden. With
  the variant class on, assets/fuel01-global.css hides the control row and the
  white mobile icon strip and shows this row in their place, inside the same
  link, on the section's own colour.

  What changes against control: the sale label and the countdown go away on
  both breakpoints, the offer text (append_text, "30% RABATT" on the Swedish
  market) stays on mobile only, and the payment icons stay on both. The new
  copy is the test's own line and is not merchant copy, so it is written here.

  Accepts:
  - section: {Object} the hosting offer-timebar section, for its settings and
    payment icon blocks (required)
{% endcomment %}
<div
  class="fuel01-v fuel01-bar"
  style="display: none; background-color: {{ section.settings.secondary_color }}; color: {{ section.settings.primary_color }};">
  <div class="fuel01-bar__inner">
    <p class="fuel01-bar__copy">Bygg din doftkapsel &ndash; välj 3 dofter, få 1 gratis</p>
    <div class="fuel01-bar__extras">
      {%- if section.settings.append_text != blank -%}
        <span class="fuel01-bar__offer">{{ section.settings.append_text }}</span>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
        <div class="fuel01-bar__icons">
          {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
            <img
              class="fuel01-bar__icon"
              src="{{ block.settings.icon | image_url: height: 50 }}"
              height="25"
              width=""
              alt="{{ block.settings.label }}">
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
